WEBVTT

00:06:59.036 --> 00:07:02.276
So when looking out the window,
what's it look like?

00:07:04.356 --> 00:07:08.276
(Laughter)

00:07:08.316 --> 00:07:10.356
If you switch your lights on,

00:07:10.396 --> 00:07:12.116
right, it looks like mud.

00:07:12.156 --> 00:07:14.396
You have a lot of places
that are very flat.

00:07:14.436 --> 00:07:16.196
Lovely, luscious, golden-brown.

00:07:16.236 --> 00:07:18.236
That's a good, healthy sea floor, OK.

00:07:18.276 --> 00:07:20.796
Sometimes you see some rocks
and some rocky outcrops.

00:07:20.796 --> 00:07:22.916
You see cobbles and rocks and boulders.

00:07:22.956 --> 00:07:24.276
Sometimes it's a bit crazy.

00:07:24.276 --> 00:07:27.716
But none of these images look that weird.

00:07:27.716 --> 00:07:29.996
They look like something
you would expect to see

00:07:29.996 --> 00:07:31.636
if you were scuba diving at night.